> The fact that different vehicles in SITL have the same UUID is for sure a problem but I'd say that it should be fixed on the firmware side.

This is the problem. All the vehicles start with same UUID. Any work around for this, for now? We do have the seperate system id's...

@shakthi-prashanth-m I did all that. I'm modifying my script for the new syntax.

@julianoes 

> This said, I initially planned DroneCore to be able to handle this case, so multiple vehicles with one DroneCore instance.

Have we/can we have a test case for this? It should work, but if it doesn't we need to know for sure.

